text:
This is a small white bowl, about 15 cm across, holding a few dumplings. They look green (spinach wrapper) and white, and are topped with sliced radish, chopped nuts or fried garlic, and a sauce. I count about 4-5 dumplings at roughly 25 g each, which is about 110 g. The sauce and toppings add about 30 g, for a total near 140 g.

Dumplings run about 2 kcal/g, so 110 g is roughly 220 kcal. The sauce, oil and nuts add about 60 kcal, giving about 280 kcal.

